From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 03:02:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 32/36] isolate: attribute generated export shadow failures

Carry fixed, data-free diagnostics for the first selector, selected-entry preparation, and second selector through the shadow failure boundary. Preserve guest rejection statuses without retaining request data, and expose the detail in local evidence so generated-export failures can be assigned to a concrete phase.
